{
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.8.0",
  "exporter": {
    "name": "Camunda Web Modeler",
    "version": "7b5e780"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 19,
  "id": "form_generate_document",
  "components": [
    {
      "text": "## 📄 Génération du document CAPA",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header0",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "Le système va générer automatiquement un document Word récapitulatif de cette CAPA incluant toutes les informations collectées jusqu'à présent.",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Info",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Info"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep1",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep1"
    },
    {
      "text": "## 📋 Informations CAPA",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header1",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_CAPA_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "**Numéro CAPA:** {{capaNumber}}\n\n**Titre:** {{capaTitle}}\n\n**Département:** {{department}}\n\n**Priorité:** {{priority}}\n\n**Catégorie:** {{capaCategory}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_CAPA_Info",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_CAPA_Info"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep2",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep2"
    },
    {
      "text": "## 🔍 Récapitulatif de l'analyse",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header2",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Analysis_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "**Méthode d'analyse:** {{rcaMethod}}\n\n**Causes racines:**\n{{rootCauses}}\n\n**Facteurs contributifs:**\n{{contributingFactors}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Analysis_Details",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Analysis_Details"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep3",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep3"
    },
    {
      "text": "## 📝 Plan d'actions approuvé",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header3",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Plan_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Action 1\n\n**Type:** {{action1Type}}\n\n**Description:** {{action1Description}}\n\n**Responsable:** {{confirmedOwner1}}\n\n**Date limite:** {{action1Deadline}}\n\n**Budget alloué:** {{allocatedBudget1}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Action1_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Action1_Summary"
    },
    {
      "text": "### Action 2\n\n**Type:** {{action2Type}}\n\n**Description:** {{action2Description}}\n\n**Responsable:** {{confirmedOwner2}}\n\n**Date limite:** {{action2Deadline}}\n\n**Budget alloué:** {{allocatedBudget2}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Action2_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Action2_Summary",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=action2Description = null or action2Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "### Action 3\n\n**Type:** {{action3Type}}\n\n**Description:** {{action3Description}}\n\n**Responsable:** {{confirmedOwner3}}\n\n**Date limite:** {{action3Deadline}}\n\n**Budget alloué:** {{allocatedBudget3}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Action3_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Action3_Summary",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=action3Description = null or action3Description = \"\""
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**Budget total alloué:** {{totalAllocatedBudget}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Budget_Total",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Budget_Total"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep4",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep4"
    },
    {
      "text": "## ⚠️ Évaluation des risques",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header4",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "**Niveau de risque global:** {{globalRiskLevel}}\n\n**Risques résiduels:** {{residualRisks}}\n\n**Recommandations:** {{riskRecommendations}}",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Risk_Summary",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Risk_Summary"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep5",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep5"
    },
    {
      "text": "## ✅ Options de génération",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header5",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Options_Header"
    },
    {
      "label": "Format du document",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "📄 Document Word complet (.docx)",
          "value": "docx_full"
        },
        {
          "label": "📄 Document Word résumé (.docx)",
          "value": "docx_summary"
        },
        {
          "label": "📑 PDF complet (.pdf)",
          "value": "pdf_full"
        },
        {
          "label": "📑 PDF résumé (.pdf)",
          "value": "pdf_summary"
        }
      ],
      "type": "select",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Format",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Document_Format",
      "key": "documentFormat",
      "defaultValue": "docx_full",
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "searchable": true,
      "description": "Choisissez le format et le niveau de détail du document"
    },
    {
      "label": "Inclure les annexes",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Annexes",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Include_Annexes",
      "key": "includeAnnexes",
      "defaultValue": true,
      "description": "Inclure les diagrammes d'analyse, évaluation des risques détaillée, etc."
    },
    {
      "label": "Inclure l'historique des modifications",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_History",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Include_History",
      "key": "includeHistory",
      "defaultValue": false,
      "description": "Inclure l'historique complet des validations et rejets"
    },
    {
      "label": "Langue du document",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "🇫🇷 Français",
          "value": "fr"
        },
        {
          "label": "🇬🇧 English",
          "value": "en"
        },
        {
          "label": "🇪🇸 Español",
          "value": "es"
        },
        {
          "label": "🇩🇪 Deutsch",
          "value": "de"
        }
      ],
      "type": "select",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Language",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Language",
      "key": "documentLanguage",
      "defaultValue": "fr",
      "searchable": true
    },
    {
      "label": "Nom du fichier (optionnel)",
      "type": "textfield",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Filename",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Filename",
      "key": "customFilename",
      "description": "Laissez vide pour utiliser le nom par défaut: CAPA_{numéro}_{date}",
      "placeholder": "Ex: CAPA_Qualite_Nov2025"
    },
    {
      "label": "Commentaires additionnels à inclure",
      "type": "textarea",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Comments",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Additional_Comments",
      "key": "additionalComments",
      "description": "Ces commentaires seront ajoutés dans une section dédiée du document",
      "rows": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep6",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep6"
    },
    {
      "text": "## 📌 Information importante",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Header6",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Important_Header"
    },
    {
      "text": "ℹ️ Le document sera généré automatiquement et sera disponible pour téléchargement. Une copie sera également archivée dans le système pour traçabilité.\n\n⏱️ Temps estimé de génération: 10-30 secondes selon la complexité de la CAPA.\n\n📧 Une notification sera envoyée une fois le document généré.",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Important_Info",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Important_Info"
    },
    {
      "text": "---",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Sep7",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Text_Sep7"
    },
    {
      "label": "Générer le document",
      "action": "submit",
      "type": "button",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_Submit",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_Submit"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default"
}